    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A game that blends exploration and adventure</strong> , offering two modes. In the dynamic <strong>RPG mode</strong>, players confront powerful bosses and equip weapons and armor to build their strength. In the solo <strong>platformer mode</strong>, players navigate treacherous environments filled with obstacles to reclaim lost powers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open-World RPG MODE - Solo and Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an expansive open world filled with mysteries and challenges. <strong>Play solo, join friends, or connect to a server</strong> to team up with other players from around the globe. Journey across three diverse regions <strong>in search of answers about a long-lost fourth region</strong>. Equip weapons and armor to build your strength, improve your character's abilities and uncover secrets in a rich, interconnected world designed for cooperation and discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLATFORMER MODE - Solo Only</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a legendary adventurer who disappeared 1,000 years ago. <strong>This solo-only mode</strong> focuses on <strong>precise platforming</strong> and reclaiming lost powers as you navigate challenging environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A game that blends exploration and adventure</strong> , offering two modes. In the dynamic <strong>RPG mode</strong>, players confront powerful bosses and equip weapons and armor to build their strength. In the solo <strong>platformer mode</strong>, players navigate treacherous environments filled with obstacles to reclaim lost powers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open-World RPG MODE - Solo and Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an expansive open world filled with mysteries and challenges. <strong>Play solo, join friends, or connect to a server</strong> to team up with other players from around the globe. Journey across three diverse regions <strong>in search of answers about a long-lost fourth region</strong>. Equip weapons and armor to build your strength, improve your character's abilities and uncover secrets in a rich, interconnected world designed for cooperation and discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLATFORMER MODE - Solo Only</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a legendary adventurer who disappeared 1,000 years ago. <strong>This solo-only mode</strong> focuses on <strong>precise platforming</strong> and reclaiming lost powers as you navigate challenging environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
